flowchart TB
  REQ[Privacy/Tenant Deletion Request] --> POL[Policy + Legal Hold Check]
  POL -->|allowed| JOB[Resumable Deletion/Anonymization Job]
  POL -->|hold| HOLD[Record Hold / Restrict Processing]
  JOB --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  JOB --> CH[(ClickHouse)]
  JOB --> S3[(S3)]
  JOB --> SRCH[Search]
  JOB --> CACHE[Cache]
  JOB --> AUD[Audit Evidence]
